  "$Comment": [
    "The cut-selection lesson: the Sawmill mills three cuts of every species (plain planks,",
    "decorative, ornate) and sneak-F at the block picks which, previewing whatever log is placed.",
    "",
    "Three STATION_OUTPUT steps, one per cut, all on Order 1 and all qualified to the Sawmill:",
    "'_Planks' catches plain planks and the half-plank cut of every species, '_Decorative' and",
    "'_Ornate' the other two. No hand-in: with TurnInId 'giver' the quest still settles at Marn, so",
    "the player comes back to be paid and hear his next line. The iron hatchet is the second rung of",
    "the tool ladder. Retune the three Amounts to change how long the lesson runs."
  ],
